<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Serif+Display&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="account-page">
    <main class="account-shell">
      <aside class="account-story">
        <a class="account-brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">L</span><span>LifeSaver</span></a>
        <div class="account-message">
          <p class="account-kicker">RUANG PRIBADI, LEBIH TERATUR</p>
          <h1>Hal pentingmu punya <em>tempatnya.</em></h1>
          <p>Catatan, dokumen, dan jadwal tersimpan rapi di akunmu.</p>
          <div class="account-signature"><span>01</span><span>Atur hidup dengan lebih tenang</span></div>
        </div>
        <a class="account-home-link" href="/">← Kembali ke beranda</a>
      </aside>

      <section class="account-form-side">
        <div class="account-form-top">
          <span>Sudah menjadi bagian dari LifeSaver?</span>
          <a href="/register">Buat akun</a>
        </div>
        <div class="account-form-content">
          <p class="account-kicker form-kicker">SELAMAT DATANG KEMBALI</p>
          <h2>Login ke akunmu</h2>
          <p class="account-form-copy">Masuk untuk melihat urusan dan pengingat yang sudah kamu simpan.</p>

          <% if (error) { %>
            <div class="alert error"><%= error %></div>
          <% } %>

          <form method="POST" action="/login" class="account-form">
            <label>
              Email
              <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="nama@email.com" required />
            </label>
            <label>
              Password
              <input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Masukkan password" required />
            </label>
            <button type="submit" class="account-submit">Masuk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
          </form>

          <p class="account-switch-copy">Belum punya akun? <a href="/register">Daftar sekarang</a></p>
        </div>
        <p class="account-privacy">Akun pribadi. Data urusanmu hanya untukmu.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
